<PageTitle>Breadcrumb — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Breadcrumb</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    The trail back up. A named <code>&lt;nav&gt;</code> around a real list, because a page can hold
    several navigation landmarks and without the label they are announced identically.
</p>

