<h2 class="doc-h2">Collapsed</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    The ellipsis is a real button that opens the levels it hides. An ellipsis that does nothing is
    a trail with a hole in it.
</p>
<Example Source="BreadcrumbCollapsed.razor"><BreadcrumbCollapsed /></Example>

<h2 class="doc-h2">Link component</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    shadcn writes <code>asChild</code> here so the crumb can be a router <code>Link</code>. There
    is no router: a crumb is an <code>&lt;a href&gt;</code>, and Unpoly follows it. Add
    <code>up-target</code> and only the content swaps; add <code>up-preload</code> and it is
    fetched on hover.
</p>
